    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Standalone TTS-only node. Voices its <computeroutput>input</computeroutput>-resolved slot (any upstream node&apos;s output — Generate, CannedResponse, etc. — or <computeroutput>user_message</computeroutput> itself), segments it into sentences, and synthesizes each on a dedicated TTS strand, emitting PCM frames via OnTtsAudio callbacks. Unlike GenerateAndSpeak it runs no LLM inference, so it can voice canned/scripted lines or any upstream-produced answer without paying for a generation pass. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
